UID:10067646-1781442000-1781452800@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Hot Girl Summer Brunchapalooza ft. DJ Molly Parti
DESCRIPTION:Sundays are for brunch. And Brunchapalooza takes it to the next level with live entertainment\, rotating themes and cuisines and your last chance to do it big before Monday. Each month we’ll be throwing on different costumes\, serving up fresh bevs\, supporting a different non-profit\, and devouring the rotating menu at the Let’s Cook food truck! \n\n\nBrunchapalooza is back on June 14th and this month we’re fully embracing our Hot Girl Summer era.\n\n\nJoin us from 1–4 PM for an afternoon of girly pop anthems from the 90s to now\, spun by none other than @djmollyparti. Expect singalongs\, sparkle\, brunch cocktails\, good vibes\, and maybe even your new best friend because @mountainpetrescueavl will be here with puppies available for adoption.\n\n\nDress code? We highly encourage:\nSequins & sparkles\nColored wigs\, and those heels you’ve been waiting for an excuse to wear.\n\n\n\nAs always\, Brunchapalooza is free to attend\, open to everyone\, and this month’s event will help support Mountain Pet Rescue.\n\n\nCome hungry\, bring your friends\, sing way too loudly\, and help us make this the hottest brunch of the summer\n\n\n\n\n‘The Mule’ – Tasting Room \n  \n\n\n\n\n\nSay hello to The Mule – a full-service bar/event space in the home of Devil’s Foot Beverage’s production facility. Draft soda\, beer\, & wine – as well as delicious cocktails & mocktails featuring Devil’s Foot craft sodas and the largest collection of NC-made spirits in Asheville – all at your fingertips just outside of Biltmore Village! Open now for all of your beverage & party needs! devilsfootbrew.com/the-mule
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/hot-girl-summer-brunchapalooza-ft-dj-molly-parti/
LOCATION:The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages\, 131 Sweeten Creek Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/714444585_122291439716019470_3119770305179241567_n-e1780920839302.jpg
